@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = local-only-development-key

### OpenAPI
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Listar ocorrências (paginado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ocorrencias?pagina=1&tamanhoPagina=50
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Executar o pipeline Oracle -> PostgreSQL
POST {{baseUrl}}/execucoes
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
